description	"Admiral Ar'alani

A brilliant strategist and commander of the Chiss Expansionary Defense Fleet.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- Chiss Charric Pistol (3)
-- 40% Faster Velocity
-- 50% more FP damage to Jedi
- Frag Grenades (2)
- Pulse Grenades (3)
- Cryoban Grenade (2)

^5Powers:
- Tactical Assessment (Sense 2)

^6Inventory:
- Advanced Medpac ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Healing (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
- Rally
- Tactical Acumen (Ally Stat Viewer)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Fast Slicing (25% Faster)
- Getup (3)

^3Abilities:
- Enhanced Planning (Resource/Block Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]
-- +7 range
- Dash (1) ^3[CS1]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS4]
- Chiss Neurotoxin Darts (10) ^3[Melee CS2]
-- Applies Cripple and Force Focus"